# Licensing

The `argvus-fonts` package bundles third-party fonts, each under its own
license:

## Bitstream Vera Sans Mono (Bitstream Vera License)

The patched Nerd Font "BitstromWera" is based on Bitstream Vera Sans Mono
which is Copyright (c) 2003 by Bitstream, Inc. All Rights Reserved,
licensed under the Bitstream Vera License.
See `src/usr/share/fonts/Bitstream Vera Sans Mono/Bitstream Vera License.txt` for
the full license text.

## Symbols Nerd Font (MIT)

Symbols Nerd Font is Copyright (c) 2014 Ryan L McIntyre,
licensed under the MIT License.
See `src/usr/share/fonts/Symbols Nerd Font/LICENSE` for the full license text.

## Terminess Nerd Font (OFL-1.1)

Terminess Nerd Font is Copyright (c) 2010 by Dimitar Toshkov Zhekov and
Copyright (c) 2011-2021 by Tilman Blumenbach,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
See `src/usr/share/fonts/Terminess Nerd Font/LICENSE.txt` for the full license text.

## IBM Plex Mono (OFL-1.1)

IBM Plex Mono is Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp.,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
See `src/usr/share/fonts/IBM Plex Mono/OFL.txt` for the full license text.

## Font Awesome 7 Free (CC-BY-4.0)

Font Awesome Free is Copyright (c) Fonticons, Inc. (https://fontawesome.com),
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license.
Icons are CC BY 4.0; the font files are also made available under the
Font Awesome Free License which permits free commercial and personal use.

The full OFL-1.1 text is available at:

  https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/

The full CC-BY-4.0 text is available at:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
